{
  "format": "OES-HELP-1.0",
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "ru",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "kw.If",
      "name_local": "If",
      "name_en": "If",
      "kind": "keyword",
      "category_keys": [
        "common_lang",
        "control_flow"
      ],
      "signature": "Если <Выражение> Тогда ... [ИначеЕсли ... Тогда ...] [Иначе ...] КонецЕсли",
      "description": "Условное выполнение. Вычисляет логическое выражение; при значении Истина выполняет ветку Then, иначе — необязательную ветку ElsIf с собственным выражением, иначе — необязательную ветку Else.",
      "syntax_block": "if (<Expression1>) {\n    // statements\n} elsif (<Expression2>) {\n    // statements\n} else {\n    // statements\n}",
      "parameters": "<Expression1>, <Expression2> — логические выражения.",
      "return_descr": "",
      "example": "if (userInfo.IsAdmin) {\n    EnableAdminMenu();\n} else {\n    HideAdminMenu();\n}",
      "availability": "Designer, codeRunner, daemon, wenterprise-server",
      "see_also": [
        "kw.Else",
        "kw.Elseif",
        "kw.While"
      ],
      "reviewed": true,
      "syntax_block_ves": "If <Expression1> Then\n    // statements\nElsIf <Expression2> Then\n    // statements\nElse\n    // statements\nEndIf",
      "example_ves": "If userInfo.IsAdmin Then\n    EnableAdminMenu();\nElse\n    HideAdminMenu();\nEndIf",
      "modes": [
        "ves",
        "ces"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kw.Then",
      "name_local": "Then",
      "name_en": "Then",
      "kind": "keyword",
      "category_keys": [
        "common_lang",
        "control_flow"
      ],
      "signature": "",
      "description": "Завершает условие ветки If / ElsIf. Тело после Then выполняется только при истинности соответствующего выражения.",
      "syntax_block": "If <Expr> Then\n    // body\nEndIf;",
      "parameters": "",
      "return_descr": "",
      "example": "",
      "availability": "Designer, codeRunner, daemon, wenterprise-server",
      "see_also": [
        "kw.If",
        "kw.Else",
        "kw.Elseif",
        "kw.Endif"
      ],
      "reviewed": true,
      "modes": [
        "ves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kw.Else",
      "name_local": "Else",
      "name_en": "Else",
      "kind": "keyword",
      "category_keys": [
        "common_lang",
        "control_flow"
      ],
      "signature": "",
      "description": "Ветка, выполняющаяся, когда все условия If / ElsIf оказались ложными.",
      "syntax_block": "If <Expr> Then\n    // matched\nElse\n    // fallback\nEndIf;",
      "parameters": "",
      "return_descr": "",
      "example": "",
      "availability": "Designer, codeRunner, daemon, wenterprise-server",
      "see_also": [
        "kw.If",
        "kw.Elseif",
        "kw.Endif"
      ],
      "reviewed": true,
      "modes": [
        "ves",
        "ces"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kw.Elseif",
      "name_local": "Elseif",
      "name_en": "Elseif",
      "kind": "keyword",
      "category_keys": [
        "common_lang",
        "control_flow"
      ],
      "signature": "",
      "description": "Добавляет цепочечное условие к If. Проверяется, только если каждая предыдущая ветка дала Ложь.",
      "syntax_block": "If A Then\n    // …\nElsIf B Then\n    // …\nElsIf C Then\n    // …\nEndIf;",
      "parameters": "",
      "return_descr": "",
      "example": "",
      "availability": "Designer, codeRunner, daemon, wenterprise-server",
      "see_also": [
        "kw.If",
        "kw.Else",
        "kw.Endif"
      ],
      "reviewed": true,
      "modes": [
        "ves",
        "ces"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kw.Endif",
      "name_local": "Endif",
      "name_en": "Endif",
      "kind": "keyword",
      "category_keys": [
        "common_lang",
        "control_flow"
      ],
      "signature": "",
      "description": "Закрывает конструкцию If.",
      "syntax_block": "If <Expr> Then\n    // body\nEndIf;",
      "parameters": "",
      "return_descr": "",
      "example": "",
      "availability": "Designer, codeRunner, daemon, wenterprise-server",
      "see_also": [
        "kw.If"
      ],
      "reviewed": true,
      "modes": [
        "ves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kw.For",
      "name_local": "For",
      "name_en": "For",
      "kind": "keyword",
      "category_keys": [
        "common_lang",
        "control_flow"
      ],
      "signature": "",
      "description": "Счётный или итераторный цикл. Две формы: индексная (For <i> = <от> To <до> Do) и поэлементная (For Each <Элемент> In <Коллекция> Do).",
      "syntax_block": "// indexed\nfor (i = 1 To 10) {\n    // body\n}\n\n// for-each\nfor each (Item In Collection) {\n    // body\n}",
      "parameters": "",
      "return_descr": "",
      "example": "for each (Order In Customer.Orders) {\n    Total = Total + Order.Amount;\n}",
      "availability": "Designer, codeRunner, daemon, wenterprise-server",
      "see_also": [
        "kw.Foreach",
        "kw.In",
        "kw.To",
        "kw.Break",
        "kw.Continue"
      ],
      "reviewed": true,
      "syntax_block_ves": "// indexed\nFor i = 1 To 10 Do\n    // body\nEndDo;\n\n// for-each\nFor Each Item In Collection Do\n    // body\nEndDo;",
      "example_ves": "For Each Order In Customer.Orders Do\n    Total = Total + Order.Amount;\nEndDo;",
      "modes": [
        "ves",
        "ces"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kw.Foreach",
      "name_local": "Foreach",
      "name_en": "Foreach",
      "kind": "keyword",
      "category_keys": [
        "common_lang",
        "control_flow"
      ],
      "signature": "",
      "description": "Модификатор цикла, вводящий поэлементную итерацию по коллекции.",
      "syntax_block": "For Each <Item> In <Collection> Do\n    // body\nEndDo;",
      "parameters": "",
      "return_descr": "",
      "example": "",
      "availability": "Designer, codeRunner, daemon, wenterprise-server",
      "see_also": [
        "kw.For",
        "kw.In",
        "kw.Do"
      ],
      "reviewed": true,
      "modes": [
        "ves",
        "ces"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kw.To",
